    "body": "`ArgsManager::LogArgs` masks `SENSITIVE` options from `bitcoin.conf` and the command line via `logArgsPrefix`, but prints `m_settings.rw_settings` values verbatim. Secrets such as `rpcpassword`, `rpcuser`, `rpcauth`, or `torpassword` stored in `settings.json` are therefore written in cleartext to `debug.log` and startup console output.\n\nResolve each `rw_settings` key with `InterpretKey` and mask its logged value with `****` when the registered option carries `ArgsManager::SENSITIVE`, while preserving existing logging for unknown settings.\n\nTests:\n- `./build/bin/test_bitcoin --run_test=getarg_tests/logargs`\n- `./build/test/functional/feature_settings.py`",
